              "text": "చిక్కని (cikkani) is native Dravidian. DEDR 2488 lists cikkana, \"thickness\", with Kannada jigi, \"thickness, viscidity\". DEDR compares Sanskrit cikka, \"bird-lime\" (CDIAL 4780), which CDIAL reports as taken from Dravidian, or else from Munda."
